  // down to the underground canal. It is pitch dark (`IDEAS/haven.md`, the
  // mine): a figure sees only its `sight` round itself, and another member
  // is seen by their own, so the gallery is found by walking it and
  // remembered dim. The picture this draws is `mine.frame.txt`, the mine
